###############################################################################
# Q11 -- Computational resources
###############################################################################

# NEP-iteration-2 runs at about 2.4e7 atom-steps per second on an RTX 4090 GPU (Sec. III B 3).

###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Virial RMSEs are in meV/atom (no schema unit for virial; recorded as Stress with unit null). The reduced NEP variants' force RMSEs do not name the evaluation set, so their role is null; the paper does not say which training set they use, so none is linked.
# - The graphene NEP, DP and MTP comparison (Fig. 3) and literature results (Fig. 4, Tables I-II) are figure-only or quoted. Phonons, spectral and total thermal conductivities are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
